{"html_text": {"ja291:0.1": "<article id='ja291'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja291:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja291:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja291:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja291:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja291:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja291:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja291:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja291:4.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja291:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja291:0.2": "Tikanipāta ", "ja291:0.3": "Kumbhavagga ", "ja291:0.4": "1. Surāghaṭajātaka ", "ja291:1.1": "“Sabbakāmadadaṁ kumbhaṁ, ", "ja291:1.2": "kuṭaṁ laddhāna dhuttako; ", "ja291:1.3": "Yāva naṁ anupāleti, ", "ja291:1.4": "tāva so sukhamedhati. ", "ja291:2.1": "Yadā matto ca ditto ca, ", "ja291:2.2": "pamādā kumbhamabbhidā; ", "ja291:2.3": "Tadā naggo ca pottho ca, ", "ja291:2.4": "pacchā bālo vihaññati. ", "ja291:3.1": "Evameva yo dhanaṁ laddhā, ", "ja291:3.2": "Pamatto paribhuñjati; ", "ja291:3.3": "Pacchā tappati dummedho, ", "ja291:3.4": "Kuṭaṁ bhitvāva dhuttako”ti. ", "ja291:4.1": "Surāghaṭajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja291:0.1": "", "ja291:0.2": "", "ja291:0.3": "", "ja291:0.4": "", "ja291:1.1": "", "ja291:1.2": "", "ja291:1.3": "", "ja291:1.4": "", "ja291:2.1": "", "ja291:2.2": "", "ja291:2.3": "", "ja291:2.4": "", "ja291:3.1": "", "ja291:3.2": "Pamatto → amattā (bj); amatto (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja291:3.3": "", "ja291:3.4": "Kuṭaṁ bhitvāva → kuṭaṁ bhinnova (bj, pts-vp-pli1); kūṭaṁ bhitvāva 